// parseWorkers returns the number of goroutines ParseBatchForInserts uses to
// parse one page concurrently. SQD_PARSE_WORKERS overrides; unset/invalid
// auto-sizes to runtime.NumCPU() (capped at maxParseWorkers). SQD_PARSE_WORKERS=1
// disables parallel parsing (splitJSONLChunks always returns a single chunk).
